{
  "duration": 62.36,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Apple's folding iPhone isn't there to sell.",
      "start": 0.16,
      "end": 2.92,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "It's there to make the others look cheap.",
      "start": 2.96,
      "end": 5.24,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "In September, Apple launched its first folding phone, the iPhone Duo.",
      "start": 5.59,
      "end": 10.32,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "$1,999.",
      "start": 10.4,
      "end": 13.28,
      "matched": "1/1"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "At the same event, the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max both went up a hundred dollars.",
      "start": 13.32,
      "end": 18.72,
      "matched": "17/17"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "But the fold got the spotlight.",
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 20.5,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 22.16,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "It's called anchoring.",
      "start": 22.24,
      "end": 23.84,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "The first big number you see becomes your ruler.",
      "start": 23.92,
      "end": 27.04,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "In 1974, psychologists Tversky and Kahneman spun a rigged wheel that stopped on 10 or 65.",
      "start": 27.107,
      "end": 34.12,
      "matched": "16/16"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Then they asked what share of UN countries were in Africa.",
      "start": 34.16,
      "end": 37.68,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "People who saw 10 guessed 25 percent.",
      "start": 37.8,
      "end": 40.67,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "People who saw 65 guessed 45.",
      "start": 40.85,
      "end": 43.813,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "A $1,999 phone moves your answer too.",
      "start": 43.867,
      "end": 48.093,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "And it does a second job.",
      "start": 48.16,
      "end": 49.88,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "It gives the price rise somewhere to hide.",
      "start": 49.92,
      "end": 52.411,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, show your premium option first.",
      "start": 52.48,
      "end": 56.08,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Your best seller looks reasonable next to it.",
      "start": 56.16,
      "end": 58.48,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Send this to the friend who hides his best package at the bottom.",
      "start": 58.76,
      "end": 61.76,
      "matched": "13/13"
    }
  ],
